<Section title="Principle of Superposition" id="superposition">
</Section>

<SubSection title="Principle of Superposition " id="principle_of_superposition_">

Superposition: If the displacements are (1) small and (2) linearly related to the force components acting, the displacements caused by the components can be added up:

<DisplayEquation equation='\\delta = \\sum_i \\delta_i = \\sum_i \\frac{F_i L_i}{E_i A_i}\\' title="Superposition." background="True" />

</SubSection>

